TEXT 1592 744 Left 2 !.param VBUS=75 IPK=120 LLOAD=5u VDRV=5
TEXT 1600 768 Left 2 !.param TSTART=0.5u TON1={LLOAD*IPK/VBUS} TOFF=1u TON2=0.5u
TEXT 1600 792 Left 2 !.param T1={TSTART+TON1} T2={T1+TOFF}
TEXT 584 872 Left 2 ;baseline close to the Q3D board (~0.2 nH effective loop, 8 mohm at 100 MHz); case steps follow AN020 / the paralleling paper
TEXT 880 912 Left 2 !.param LLOOP=0.1n RLOOP=8m RKS=0.1
TEXT 880 936 Left 2 !.param LD1=0.5n LD2={if(CASE==1,0.9n,0.5n)}
TEXT 880 960 Left 2 !.param LG1=2n LG2={if(CASE==2,8n,2n)}
TEXT 880 984 Left 2 !.param LS1=0.05n LS2={if(CASE==4,0.25n,0.05n)}
TEXT 880 1008 Left 2 !.param KELVIN={if(CASE==3|CASE==4,0,1)}
TEXT 880 1032 Left 2 !.param RG1=10 RG2=10 DVTH1=0 DVTH2={if(CASE==5,0.3,0)}
TEXT 1832 1072 Left 2 !.param CASE 2
TEXT 880 1080 Left 2 !.include ../LMG1210-EPC2361/EPC2361.lib
TEXT 880 1104 Left 2 !.tran 0 {T2+TON2+0.5u} 0 0.1n
TEXT 872 1128 Left 2 !.options plotwinsize=0
TEXT 2256 256 Left 2 !.meas TRAN I1_off FIND I(LD1) AT {T1}
TEXT 2248 280 Left 2 !.meas TRAN I2_off FIND I(LD2) AT {T1}
TEXT 2248 304 Left 2 !.meas TRAN I1_pk MAX I(LD1) FROM {T2} TO {T2+100n}
TEXT 2248 328 Left 2 !.meas TRAN I2_pk MAX I(LD2) FROM {T2} TO {T2+100n}
TEXT 2248 352 Left 2 !.meas TRAN Eon1 INTEG V(D1,S1)*I(LD1) FROM {T2} TO {T2+100n}
TEXT 2248 376 Left 2 !.meas TRAN Eon2 INTEG V(D2,S2)*I(LD2) FROM {T2} TO {T2+100n}
TEXT 2248 400 Left 2 !.meas TRAN Eoff1 INTEG V(D1,S1)*I(LD1) FROM {T1} TO {T1+100n}
TEXT 2248 424 Left 2 !.meas TRAN Eoff2 INTEG V(D2,S2)*I(LD2) FROM {T1} TO {T1+100n}
TEXT 2248 448 Left 2 !.meas TRAN VDS_pk MAX V(D1) FROM {T1} TO {T1+100n}
TEXT 2248 472 Left 2 !.meas TRAN VDSH_pk MAX V(DH,SW) FROM {T2} TO {T2+100n}
TEXT 2248 496 Left 2 !.meas TRAN Idiff_on PARAM (I1_pk-I2_pk)/(I1_pk+I2_pk)
TEXT 2248 520 Left 2 !.meas TRAN Ediff_on PARAM (Eon1-Eon2)/(Eon1+Eon2)
TEXT 16 16 Left 3 ;Two parallel EPC2361: current sharing vs power-loop (LD), source / common-source (LS), gate-loop (LG) inductance and Vth mismatch
TEXT 1664 1032 Left 2 ;CASE 0 baseline | 1 LD2 +0.3 nH (power loop) | 2 LG2 2->8 nH (gate loop) | 3 no Kelvin (LS = CSI) | 4 no Kelvin + LS2 +0.2 nH (CSI imbalance) | 5 Vth2 +0.3 V
TEXT 72 1304 Left 2 ;Plot: I(LD1), I(LD2) drain currents | V(D1,S1) | V(G1,S1), V(G2,S2) | V(DH,SW). Low-side DPT: Vdrv pulses QL1+QL2 twice; QH is held off by Rgh.
TEXT 48 1256 Left 2 ;KELVIN=1: driver returns at the die sources through RK1/RK2 (LS only in the power loop). KELVIN=0: driver returns at power ground through Rp (LS shared = common-source inductance).
